{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謝廣南海藏主"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "堅拂子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淦州判李濟川，世居饒。昔有以絹素繪大士像，為風水所漂。後二十年，漁人網\n\n得之，像不壞。濟川重新裝飾，請贊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0648001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0648001", "type": "orig", "text": "□□疑子即"}
